{"task_id": "Mbpp/20", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to check if the given number is woodball or not.\nassert is_woodall(383) == True\n\"\"\"\ndef is_woodall(n):\n    \"\"\"Check if n is a Woodall number (n = k*2^k - 1 for some positive integer k).\"\"\"\n    if n < 1:\n        return False\n    \n    k = 1\n    while k * (2 ** k) - 1 <= n:\n        if k * (2 ** k) - 1 == n:\n            return True\n        k += 1\n    return False"}
