{"task_id": "Mbpp/77", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to find whether a number is divisible by 11.\nassert is_Diff (12345) == False\n\"\"\"\ndef is_Diff(n):\n    # Calculate alternating sum of digits to check divisibility by 11\n    n = abs(n)\n    alternating_sum = 0\n    sign = 1\n    \n    while n > 0:\n        digit = n % 10\n        alternating_sum += sign * digit\n        sign *= -1\n        n //= 10\n    \n    return alternating_sum % 11 == 0"}
