{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to find the nth number in the newman conway sequence.\nassert sequence(10) == 6\n\"\"\"\n```python\ndef sequence(n):\n    \"\"\"Returns the nth number in the Newman-Conway sequence.\"\"\"\n    if n <= 2:\n        return 1\n    \n    # Build sequence iteratively\n    seq = [0, 1, 1]  # index 0 unused, seq[1]=1, seq[2]=1\n    \n    for i in range(3, n + 1):\n        seq.append(seq[seq[i-1]] + seq[i - seq[i-1]])\n    \n    return seq[n]\n```"}
