{"task_id": "Mbpp/286", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to find the largest sum of a contiguous array in the modified array which is formed by repeating the given array k times.\nassert max_sub_array_sum_repeated([10, 20, -30, -1], 4, 3) == 30\n\"\"\"\ndef max_sub_array_sum_repeated(arr, n, k):\n    \"\"\"Find the maximum subarray sum in an array repeated k times.\"\"\"\n    # Handle edge cases\n    if not arr or k == 0:\n        return 0\n    \n    # Calculate single array maximum subarray sum using Kadane's algorithm\n    def kadane(array):\n        max_sum = float('-inf')\n        current_sum = 0\n        for num in array:\n            current_sum = max(num, current_sum + num)\n            max_sum = max(max_sum, current_sum)\n        return max_sum\n    \n    # If k == 1, return standard maximum subarray sum\n    if k == 1:\n        return kadane(arr)\n    \n    # Calculate prefix and suffix sums\n    prefix_max = float('-inf')\n    current_sum = 0\n    for i in range(len(arr)):\n        current_sum += arr[i]\n        prefix_max = max(prefix_max, current_sum)\n    \n    suffix_max = float('-inf')\n    current_sum = 0\n    for i in range(len(arr) - 1, -1, -1):\n        current_sum += arr[i]\n        suffix_max = max(suffix_max, current_sum)\n    \n    # Total sum of one complete array\n    total_sum = sum(arr)\n    \n    # Maximum subarray sum in single array\n    single_max = kadane(arr)\n    \n    # Case 1: Maximum subarray is within one array\n    result = single_max\n    \n    # Case 2: Maximum subarray spans multiple arrays\n    if k == 2:\n        # Can span at most 2 arrays\n        result = max(result, suffix_max + prefix_max)\n    else:\n        # Can span more than 2 arrays\n        if total_sum > 0:\n            # Include middle arrays if total sum is positive\n            result = max(result, suffix_max + prefix_max + (k - 2) * total_sum)\n        else:\n            # Don't include middle arrays if total sum is negative\n            result = max(result, suffix_max + prefix_max)\n    \n    return result"}
