{"task_id": "Mbpp/415", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to find a pair with highest product from a given array of integers.\nassert max_Product([1,2,3,4,7,0,8,4]) == (7,8)\n\"\"\"\ndef max_Product(arr):\n    \"\"\"Find the pair with the highest product from the given array.\"\"\"\n    max_prod = float('-inf')\n    result_pair = None\n    \n    for i in range(len(arr)):\n        for j in range(i + 1, len(arr)):\n            prod = arr[i] * arr[j]\n            if prod > max_prod:\n                max_prod = prod\n                result_pair = (arr[i], arr[j])\n    \n    return result_pair"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/415", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to find a pair with highest product from a given array of integers.\nassert max_Product([1,2,3,4,7,0,8,4]) == (7,8)\n\"\"\"\n```python\ndef max_Product(arr):\n    if len(arr) < 2:\n        return None\n    \n    max1 = max2 = float('-inf')\n    min1 = min2 = float('inf')\n    \n    for num in arr:\n        if num > max1:\n            max2 = max1\n            max1 = num\n        elif num > max2:\n            max2 = num\n            \n        if num < min1:\n            min2 = min1\n            min1 = num\n        elif num < min2:\n            min2 = num\n    \n    if max1 * max2 > min1 * min2:\n        return (max2, max1)\n    else:\n        return (min2, min1)\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/414", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to check whether any value in a sequence exists in a sequence or not.\nassert overlapping([1,2,3,4,5],[6,7,8,9]) == False\n\"\"\"\n```python\ndef overlapping(seq1, seq2):\n    \"\"\"Check if any value from seq1 exists in seq2.\"\"\"\n    for item in seq1:\n        if item in seq2:\n            return True\n    return False\n```"}
