{"task_id": "Mbpp/448", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to calculate the sum of perrin numbers.\nassert cal_sum(9) == 49\n\"\"\"\ndef cal_sum(n):\n    \"\"\"Calculate sum of first n perrin numbers.\"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        return 0\n    \n    # Generate perrin numbers: P(0)=3, P(1)=0, P(2)=2, P(n)=P(n-2)+P(n-3)\n    if n == 1:\n        return 3\n    elif n == 2:\n        return 3\n    elif n == 3:\n        return 5\n    \n    # Initialize first three perrin numbers\n    p0, p1, p2 = 3, 0, 2\n    total = p0 + p1 + p2\n    \n    # Generate remaining perrin numbers and add to sum\n    for i in range(3, n):\n        next_p = p1 + p0\n        total += next_p\n        p0, p1, p2 = p1, p2, next_p\n    \n    return total"}
