{"task_id": "Mbpp/580", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to remove uneven elements in the nested mixed tuple.\nassert extract_even((4, 5, (7, 6, (2, 4)), 6, 8)) == (4, (6, (2, 4)), 6, 8)\n\"\"\"\n```python\ndef extract_even(tup):\n    \"\"\"Remove odd elements from nested mixed tuple, keeping even numbers and nested tuples.\"\"\"\n    result = []\n    for item in tup:\n        if isinstance(item, tuple):\n            nested_result = extract_even(item)\n            if nested_result:  # Only add non-empty tuples\n                result.append(nested_result)\n        elif isinstance(item, int) and item % 2 == 0:\n            result.append(item)\n    return tuple(result)\n```"}
