{"task_id": "Mbpp/589", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to find perfect squares between two given numbers.\nassert perfect_squares(1,30)==[1, 4, 9, 16, 25]\n\"\"\"\n```python\ndef perfect_squares(start, end):\n    \"\"\"Returns a list of perfect squares between start and end (inclusive).\"\"\"\n    result = []\n    i = 1\n    while i * i <= end:\n        square = i * i\n        if square >= start:\n            result.append(square)\n        i += 1\n    return result\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/589", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to find perfect squares between two given numbers.\nassert perfect_squares(1,30)==[1, 4, 9, 16, 25]\n\"\"\"\n```python\ndef perfect_squares(start, end):\n    \"\"\"Find all perfect squares between start and end (inclusive).\"\"\"\n    result = []\n    i = 1\n    while i * i <= end:\n        square = i * i\n        if square >= start:\n            result.append(square)\n        i += 1\n    return result\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/592", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to find the sum of the product of consecutive binomial co-efficients.\nassert sum_Of_product(3) == 15\n\"\"\"\ndef sum_Of_product(n):\n    \"\"\"Returns the sum of products of consecutive binomial coefficients.\"\"\"\n    def binomial_coeff(n, k):\n        if k > n or k < 0:\n            return 0\n        if k == 0 or k == n:\n            return 1\n        result = 1\n        for i in range(min(k, n - k)):\n            result = result * (n - i) // (i + 1)\n        return result\n    \n    total = 0\n    for i in range(n):\n        coeff1 = binomial_coeff(n, i)\n        coeff2 = binomial_coeff(n, i + 1)\n        total += coeff1 * coeff2\n    \n    return total"}
