{"task_id": "Mbpp/592", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to find the sum of the product of consecutive binomial co-efficients.\nassert sum_Of_product(3) == 15\n\"\"\"\ndef sum_Of_product(n):\n    \"\"\"Calculate sum of products of consecutive binomial coefficients.\"\"\"\n    def binomial_coeff(n, k):\n        if k > n or k < 0:\n            return 0\n        if k == 0 or k == n:\n            return 1\n        result = 1\n        for i in range(min(k, n - k)):\n            result = result * (n - i) // (i + 1)\n        return result\n    \n    total = 0\n    for i in range(n):\n        coeff1 = binomial_coeff(n, i)\n        coeff2 = binomial_coeff(n, i + 1)\n        total += coeff1 * coeff2\n    \n    return total"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/590", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to convert polar coordinates to rectangular coordinates.\nassert polar_rect(3,4)==((5.0, 0.9272952180016122), (-2+2.4492935982947064e-16j))\n\"\"\"\ndef polar_rect(x, y):\n    \"\"\"Convert rectangular coordinates to polar and compute complex representation.\"\"\"\n    import math\n    r = math.sqrt(x*x + y*y)\n    theta = math.atan2(y, x)\n    complex_form = complex(x, y)\n    return ((r, theta), complex_form)"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/590", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to convert polar coordinates to rectangular coordinates.\nassert polar_rect(3,4)==((5.0, 0.9272952180016122), (-2+2.4492935982947064e-16j))\n\"\"\"\ndef polar_rect(r, theta):\n    \"\"\"Convert polar coordinates (r, theta) to rectangular coordinates (x, y).\"\"\"\n    import cmath\n    x = r * cmath.cos(theta)\n    y = r * cmath.sin(theta)\n    magnitude = abs(complex(x.real, y.real))\n    angle = cmath.phase(complex(x.real, y.real))\n    return ((magnitude, angle), complex(x.real, y.real))"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/594", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to find the difference of the first even and first odd number of a given list.\nassert diff_even_odd([1,3,5,7,4,1,6,8])==3\n\"\"\"\ndef diff_even_odd(lst):\n    \"\"\"Find the difference between the first even and first odd number in the list.\"\"\"\n    first_even = None\n    first_odd = None\n    \n    for num in lst:\n        if num % 2 == 0 and first_even is None:\n            first_even = num\n        elif num % 2 == 1 and first_odd is None:\n            first_odd = num\n        \n        if first_even is not None and first_odd is not None:\n            break\n    \n    return first_even - first_odd"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/594", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to find the difference of the first even and first odd number of a given list.\nassert diff_even_odd([1,3,5,7,4,1,6,8])==3\n\"\"\"\n```python\ndef diff_even_odd(lst):\n    \"\"\"Find the difference between the first even and first odd number in the list.\"\"\"\n    first_even = None\n    first_odd = None\n    \n    for num in lst:\n        if num % 2 == 0 and first_even is None:\n            first_even = num\n        elif num % 2 == 1 and first_odd is None:\n            first_odd = num\n        \n        if first_even is not None and first_odd is not None:\n            break\n    \n    return first_even - first_odd\n```"}
