{"task_id": "Mbpp/733", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to find the index of the first occurrence of a given number in a sorted array.\nassert find_first_occurrence([2, 5, 5, 5, 6, 6, 8, 9, 9, 9], 5) == 1\n\"\"\"\ndef find_first_occurrence(arr, target):\n    \"\"\"Find the index of the first occurrence of target in sorted array.\"\"\"\n    left, right = 0, len(arr) - 1\n    result = -1\n    \n    while left <= right:\n        mid = (left + right) // 2\n        if arr[mid] == target:\n            result = mid\n            right = mid - 1\n        elif arr[mid] < target:\n            left = mid + 1\n        else:\n            right = mid - 1\n    \n    return result"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/736", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to locate the left insertion point for a specified value in sorted order. \nassert left_insertion([1,2,4,5],6)==4\n\"\"\"\n```python\ndef left_insertion(arr, value):\n    \"\"\"Find the leftmost insertion point for value in sorted array.\"\"\"\n    left, right = 0, len(arr)\n    while left < right:\n        mid = (left + right) // 2\n        if arr[mid] < value:\n            left = mid + 1\n        else:\n            right = mid\n    return left\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/731", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to find the lateral surface area of a cone given radius r and the height h.\nassert lateralsurface_cone(5,12)==204.20352248333654\n\"\"\"\n```python\ndef lateralsurface_cone(r, h):\n    \"\"\"Calculate the lateral surface area of a cone given radius and height.\"\"\"\n    import math\n    slant_height = math.sqrt(r**2 + h**2)\n    return math.pi * r * slant_height\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/736", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to locate the left insertion point for a specified value in sorted order. \nassert left_insertion([1,2,4,5],6)==4\n\"\"\"\ndef left_insertion(arr, value):\n    \"\"\"Find the leftmost position to insert value in sorted order.\"\"\"\n    left, right = 0, len(arr)\n    while left < right:\n        mid = (left + right) // 2\n        if arr[mid] < value:\n            left = mid + 1\n        else:\n            right = mid\n    return left"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/735", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to toggle bits of the number except the first and the last bit. \nassert toggle_middle_bits(9) == 15\n\"\"\"\n```python\ndef toggle_middle_bits(n):\n    # Find the position of the most significant bit\n    if n <= 1:\n        return n\n    \n    # Count the number of bits in the number\n    bit_count = n.bit_length()\n    \n    # If there are 2 or fewer bits, no middle bits to toggle\n    if bit_count <= 2:\n        return n\n    \n    # Create a mask with middle bits set to 1\n    mask = 0\n    for i in range(1, bit_count - 1):\n        mask |= (1 << i)\n    \n    # Toggle the middle bits using XOR\n    return n ^ mask\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/734", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to find sum of products of all possible sublists of a given list. \nassert sum_Of_Subarray_Prod([1,2,3]) == 20\n\"\"\"\ndef sum_Of_Subarray_Prod(arr):\n    \"\"\"Find sum of products of all possible sublists.\"\"\"\n    total = 0\n    n = len(arr)\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            product = 1\n            for k in range(i, j + 1):\n                product *= arr[k]\n            total += product\n    return total"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/735", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to toggle bits of the number except the first and the last bit. \nassert toggle_middle_bits(9) == 15\n\"\"\"\ndef toggle_middle_bits(n):\n    \"\"\"Toggle all bits except the first and last bit of the number.\"\"\"\n    if n <= 3:\n        return n\n    \n    # Find the position of the most significant bit\n    msb_pos = n.bit_length() - 1\n    \n    # Create mask for middle bits (all bits except first and last)\n    mask = ((1 << (msb_pos - 1)) - 1) << 1\n    \n    return n ^ mask"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/734", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to find sum of products of all possible sublists of a given list. \nassert sum_Of_Subarray_Prod([1,2,3]) == 20\n\"\"\"\n```python\ndef sum_Of_Subarray_Prod(arr):\n    \"\"\"Returns sum of products of all possible sublists.\"\"\"\n    n = len(arr)\n    total = 0\n    \n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            product = 1\n            for k in range(i, j + 1):\n                product *= arr[k]\n            total += product\n    \n    return total\n```"}
