{"task_id": "Mbpp/739", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to find the index of smallest triangular number with n digits. \nassert find_Index(2) == 4\n\"\"\"\n```python\ndef find_Index(n):\n    # Find the smallest triangular number with exactly n digits\n    min_val = 10 ** (n - 1)  # smallest n-digit number\n    \n    # Start from index 1 and find first triangular number >= min_val\n    index = 1\n    while True:\n        triangular = index * (index + 1) // 2\n        if triangular >= min_val:\n            return index\n        index += 1\n```"}
