{"task_id": "Mbpp/751", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to check if the given array represents min heap or not. \nassert check_min_heap([1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]) == True\n\"\"\"\ndef check_min_heap(arr):\n    \"\"\"Check if array represents a min heap where parent <= children.\"\"\"\n    n = len(arr)\n    for i in range(n // 2):\n        left_child = 2 * i + 1\n        right_child = 2 * i + 2\n        \n        if left_child < n and arr[i] > arr[left_child]:\n            return False\n        if right_child < n and arr[i] > arr[right_child]:\n            return False\n    \n    return True"}
