{"task_id": "Mbpp/799", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to that rotate left bits by d bits a given number. We assume that the number is 32 bit.\nassert left_rotate(16,2) == 64\n\"\"\"\ndef left_rotate(n, d):\n    \"\"\"Rotate left bits by d positions for a 32-bit number.\"\"\"\n    d = d % 32\n    return ((n << d) | (n >> (32 - d))) & 0xFFFFFFFF"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/799", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to that rotate left bits by d bits a given number. We assume that the number is 32 bit.\nassert left_rotate(16,2) == 64\n\"\"\"\ndef left_rotate(num, d):\n    \"\"\"Rotate left bits by d positions for a 32-bit number.\"\"\"\n    d = d % 32\n    return ((num << d) | (num >> (32 - d))) & 0xFFFFFFFF"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/801", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to count the number of equal numbers from three given integers.\nassert test_three_equal(1,1,1) == 3\n\"\"\"\ndef test_three_equal(a, b, c):\n    \"\"\"Count the number of equal numbers from three given integers.\"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    if a == b:\n        count += 1\n    if b == c:\n        count += 1\n    if a == c:\n        count += 1\n    \n    if count == 3:\n        return 3\n    elif count == 1:\n        return 2\n    else:\n        return 1"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/803", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to check whether the given number is a perfect square or not. \nassert not is_perfect_square(10)\n\"\"\"\ndef is_perfect_square(num):\n    \"\"\"Check if a number is a perfect square.\"\"\"\n    if num < 0:\n        return False\n    sqrt_num = int(num ** 0.5)\n    return sqrt_num * sqrt_num == num"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/803", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to check whether the given number is a perfect square or not. \nassert not is_perfect_square(10)\n\"\"\"\n```python\ndef is_perfect_square(n):\n    \"\"\"Check if a number is a perfect square.\"\"\"\n    if n < 0:\n        return False\n    root = int(n ** 0.5)\n    return root * root == n\n```"}
