{"task_id": "Mbpp/57", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to find the largest number that can be formed with the given list of digits.\nassert find_Max_Num([1,2,3]) == 321\n\"\"\"\ndef find_Max_Num(digits):\n    # Convert digits to strings and sort in descending order based on concatenation priority\n    str_digits = [str(d) for d in digits]\n    str_digits.sort(key=lambda x: x*10, reverse=True)\n    return int(''.join(str_digits))"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/11", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to remove first and last occurrence of a given character from the string.\nassert remove_Occ(\"hello\",\"l\") == \"heo\"\n\"\"\"\ndef remove_Occ(s, char):\n    # Find first and last occurrence positions\n    first_pos = s.find(char)\n    last_pos = s.rfind(char)\n    \n    if first_pos == -1:\n        return s\n    \n    if first_pos == last_pos:\n        return s[:first_pos] + s[first_pos + 1:]\n    \n    # Remove last occurrence first to preserve indices\n    result = s[:last_pos] + s[last_pos + 1:]\n    # Find first occurrence in the modified string\n    first_pos = result.find(char)\n    if first_pos != -1:\n        result = result[:first_pos] + result[first_pos + 1:]\n    \n    return result"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/11", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to remove first and last occurrence of a given character from the string.\nassert remove_Occ(\"hello\",\"l\") == \"heo\"\n\"\"\"\n```python\ndef remove_Occ(s, char):\n    \"\"\"Remove first and last occurrence of given character from string.\"\"\"\n    first_idx = s.find(char)\n    if first_idx == -1:\n        return s\n    \n    last_idx = s.rfind(char)\n    \n    if first_idx == last_idx:\n        return s[:first_idx] + s[first_idx + 1:]\n    \n    result = s[:first_idx] + s[first_idx + 1:last_idx] + s[last_idx + 1:]\n    return result\n```"}
