{"task_id": "Mbpp/235", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to set all even bits of a given number.\nassert even_bit_set_number(10) == 10\n\"\"\"\ndef even_bit_set_number(n):\n    \"\"\"Set all even-positioned bits (0, 2, 4, ...) to 1.\"\"\"\n    mask = 0x55555555  # Binary: 01010101...\n    return n | mask"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/235", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to set all even bits of a given number.\nassert even_bit_set_number(10) == 10\n\"\"\"\ndef even_bit_set_number(n):\n    \"\"\"Set all even position bits (0, 2, 4, 6, ...) to 1.\"\"\"\n    mask = 0\n    i = 0\n    while (1 << i) <= n or i < 32:\n        if i % 2 == 0:\n            mask |= (1 << i)\n        i += 1\n    return n | mask"}
